{"id":"e3a691aa8eb9a794","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map.md","title":"ZFC Measure5 Measure Preserving Map","display":"df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Measure5 Measure Preserving Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map"],"display":"df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Measure5 Measure Preserving Map","depends_on":["[[58-df-measurable-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-map-preimage]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map — ZFC Measure5 Measure Preserving Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6bcdecbdd77201ee\" href=\"?note=6bcdecbdd77201ee\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space\">58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ff9b8482d2bc3a99\" href=\"?note=ff9b8482d2bc3a99\" title=\"58-df-zfc-map-preimage\">58-df-zfc-map-preimage</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,f,E\">\\(X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,f,E\\)</span> (sets, measures, and function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S\\)</span> (measurable function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bbbec05fde1d3b01\" href=\"?note=bbbec05fde1d3b01\" title=\"58-df-measurable-function\">58-df-measurable-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6bcdecbdd77201ee\" href=\"?note=6bcdecbdd77201ee\" title=\"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space\">58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S\\)</span> (set-theoretic preimage predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists P\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,E)\\land\\mu(P)=\\nu(E)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists P\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,E)\\land\\mu(P)=\\nu(E)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each inverse image is a set witness in the source sigma algebra before its measure is compared with the target measure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measurable-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space","status":"resolved","id":"6bcdecbdd77201ee","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-map-preimage","status":"resolved","id":"ff9b8482d2bc3a99","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-map-preimage]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measurable-function","status":"resolved","id":"bbbec05fde1d3b01","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S$ (measurable function predicate, see [[58-df-measurable-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space","status":"resolved","id":"6bcdecbdd77201ee","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S$ (measure predicate, see [[58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-on-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\mathcal A,\\mathcal B,\\mu,\\nu,f,E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure5\\text{-}measure\\text{-}preserving\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurePreservingMap}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu,Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu,f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasurableFunction}_S(X,\\mathcal A,Y,\\mathcal B,f)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(X,\\mathcal A,\\mu)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure5MeasureOnSpace}_S(Y,\\mathcal B,\\nu)\\land\\forall E\\in\\mathcal B\\;\\exists P\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcMapPreimage}_S(P,f,E)\\land\\mu(P)=\\nu(E)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1548,"backlinks":[{"id":"04875e321b3948c5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2612","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map.md|58-df-zfc-measure5-measure-preserving-map]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["bbbec05fde1d3b01","6bcdecbdd77201ee","ff9b8482d2bc3a99"]}